WEBVTT

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:02.800
Come here quickly!

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.020
Come here immediately!

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:05.720
Let the three of us play 'til we drop!

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.020
Say bye-bye to the teacher after class!

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:20.530
And bring back your gym clothes!

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:25.400
Wanna gather at the schoolyard to play?

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:28.160
Aren't you gonna give a good excuse?

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:30.710
Just leave that homework alone!

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:35.700
Let's swing around the metal bars instead!

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:40.770
That red backpack sure is strong

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:43.350
One, two, line up in threes!

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:45.880
And dash forward with the pencil case after school!

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:50.950
You'll forget about it, so cheer up!

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:50.950
One

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:50.950
Two!

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:53.470
Hey Mr.! Turn around that corner!

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:57.760
Let's have a large assembly in the schoolyard!

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:00.100
Just who am I?

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:05.990
Can I still have fun when I grow up?

00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:10.700
I don't know, but I just wanna know!

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:16.060
If we can still laugh over the small matters

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:20.660
I'm happy enough with that!

00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:23.340
This! That! And everything else!

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:28.200
Let the three of us play 'til we drop!

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:36.030
I Can't Reach You

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:46.640
Maybe I shouldn't...

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:49.670
At that height, I will definitely die from a heart attack.

00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:53.360
That light needs to be replaced, right?

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:55.710
U-um, could you, instead of me...

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:57.590
You can't reach it, can you?

00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:59.250
I'll let you sit on my shoulders.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:01.250
We did so the other day too, right?

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:02.710
No need to feel embarrassed.

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:04.640
All right, we're set now!

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:08.020
Come on, hurry and replace it already!

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.190
I can't! I can't! I can't!

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:16.540
I don't want to!

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:18.190
L-Let me down...!

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:19.440
Why?

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:23.600
Hey, what about replacing the light?

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:32.880
I think Third Daughter hates me now...

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:33.840
Why's that?!

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:36.280
Did I really do something strange?

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:39.280
No, it can't be... I just lifted her normally, right?

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:40.970
I barely made any contact with her...

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:47.720
Could it actually be that she doesn't want to hang out with me because I'm like everyone else?!

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:48.590
That can't be right!

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:50.730
I'm different from everyone else!

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:53.470
Miya, do you want to play divination by Kokkuri?

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:56.720
That's where the God of Love is said to answer your call, you know!

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:57.990
I don't think that's right.

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:00.150
yes

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:00.150
no

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:00.150
Kokkuri, Kokkuri.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.160
Will I ever find true love?

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:09.040
That Kokkuri-san is terribly honest, huh?

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.290
Kokkuri, Kokkuri...

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:14.760
Could you please go out with me?!

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:15.670
Don't ask for the impossible!

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:18.710
Stop getting confused!

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:21.470
Kokkuri sure is a good-for-nothing, huh?

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:24.740
You took another picture of them, didn't you, you damned pervert?!

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:26.840
No-That's not it, I...

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:28.420
They were Miyashita's!

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:29.060
What?

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.610
That's a lie.

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:32.180
Why don't you show me them now, then?!

00:03:32.180 --> 00:03:33.790
S-Stop that-!

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:37.590
Now I've got evidence of you being a perverted nympho!

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:38.190
Wait, just a sec-!

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:40.520
Delete it already!

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:42.910
Can't we just have a normal class?

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:45.530
Cut it out already, you idiot!

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:49.700
Shin, if you've forgotten your gym clothes, you can just borrow mine!

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:51.960
I told you to stop! It'll be okay!

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:54.390
Come on, take them off!

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:54.390
No, I'm all right!

00:03:54.390 --> 00:03:55.840
It'll be fine, I don't need-

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.340
Cut it out!

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:58.090
I told you to stop!

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:00.090
H-Hold it...!

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:02.890
He's totally got one, huh?

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:03.840
No, he doesn't!

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:05.590
And so, I'm wondering why you're acting like this...

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:09.020
Unlike the rest, I'm quite normal, you know.

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:10.320
So why are you-

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:11.600
I can see your panties.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:12.530
Listen to me!

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:14.100
Well, I can see yours too!

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:15.890
Miya.

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:19.430
Would you happen to like Third Daughter?!

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:20.320
No, that's not it-

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:22.180
Could it actually be that she's become possessed by a spirit-?!

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:23.190
N-No, you're wrong!

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:25.900
Then, why are you so desperate?

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:28.230
I-It's not that I'm desperate-

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:30.230
Desperate?

00:04:30.230 --> 00:04:32.550
That's right, I must keep my composure.

00:04:32.550 --> 00:04:35.440
Perhaps that's why Third Daughter is afraid of me!

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:37.380
Maybe I should take a softer approach with her.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:40.240
More considerate and gentle...

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:42.830
Third Daughter!

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:47.640
Why don't we go and replace that light?

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:49.970
Just who are you?

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:53.200
I'm Miyashita, damn it!

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:55.730
All of this is the fault of you guys being a bunch of weirdos!

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:56.940
Who are you?

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:57.890
You are?

00:04:57.890 --> 00:04:59.070
Who exactly are you?

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:00.660
Just who're you?

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:01.560
Who are you?

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:02.490
And you are?

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:03.920
Who is she?

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:04.650
Eh?

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:06.000
Where did Miya go?

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:10.080
Yabecchi, I don't know how, but it looks like an odd stranger got into our class some way or another.

00:05:11.030 --> 00:05:14.070
Don't go calling me odd!

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:20.500
Let's try to think positively!

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:24.520
<i>If changing my hairstyle makes me unrecognizable,</i>

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:28.480
it could let me lead a double-life like some manga characters, I guess.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:30.890
Might as well have some fun then!

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:38.100
I'm so sorry. I accidentally stepped into the wrong classroom.

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:43.210
Miyashita, what are you doing?

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:44.240
A gag-joke?

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:46.190
Why did it turn out like this?!

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:57.620
Yabecchi's Room

00:05:50.810 --> 00:05:55.050
Although I want to quit, we've started a new session of "Yabecchi's Room".

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:57.850
Today's guest will be the middle daughter of the Marui triplets!

00:05:57.820 --> 00:06:03.160
Today's guest is Marui Futaba-san

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:00.070
This would be Futaba Marui!

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:03.160
What interesting topics will we hear today, I wonder?

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:06.960
Thank goodness it's you today, Futaba.

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:09.130
Maybe we can have an meaningful, real conversation for once.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:11.930
You think so? That sounds great!

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:14.730
Well then, maybe I'll start by asking various questions...

00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:15.850
First of all,

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:18.420
why do you possess strength like a superhero, Futaba?

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:20.020
I wonder about that too.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:22.150
I have no clue.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:27.990
Well, early on, weren't you wearing a martial arts uniform?

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.520
Could it be that you've become so strong through training in martial arts or something?

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:32.330
No idea at all!

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:34.740
If you want to know about my background story, you'd best just ask the original creator.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:37.760
That isn't the point to make...

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:40.200
Wh-What is it?

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:42.410
I've spotted a cockroach!

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:43.030
What?!

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:44.500
Wh-Where?!

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.700
It's right over there! I will take care of it right now!

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:49.280
Futaba!

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:51.930
Please be gentle, remember to take care of it carefully!

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:54.050
Just wait over there!

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:54.960
Futaba!

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:57.530
This is a rental space! A rental space!!!

00:06:57.530 --> 00:07:00.640
This is quite the roach.

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:01.650
Take that!

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:04.930
Quit it!

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:09.330
Futaba, hey look here; it's your favorite kind of book!

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:10.800
Boobs!

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:16.870
Then, Futaba, on to our next discussion...

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.870
Erm, Futaba...?

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:24.200
Boobs!

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:25.850
Boobs all over the place!

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:26.980
I want to eat them!

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:29.170
I want to add some flavoring and devour them!

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:31.510
That's why I said to quit this already!

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:32.670
This is a waste of time!

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:35.410
Yabecchi, I'm leaving the preparation of the next book to you!

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:37.080
Why are you like this with me as well, Futaba?!

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:38.180
Yabecchi's Room    End

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:38.220
God!

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:45.750
7.53 seconds.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:46.810
That's awesome!

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:47.580
He's so fast!

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:49.390
That's our Satou!

00:07:49.390 --> 00:07:51.350
But, he's a pervert...

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:01.290
Just inhaling the air from Satou's running,

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.730
lets one live an extra five years, huh?

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:07.340
Shin!

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:11.810
My time was 6.2 seconds!

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:15.220
Is that so? Well, you should aim for the world record then.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:17.240
Shin, let's aim for it together!

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:18.220
Impossible.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:22.170
Since we have some extra time remaining,

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:24.810
why don't we play some boys versus girls dodgeball?

00:08:25.930 --> 00:08:27.560
I agree, I accept!

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:29.400
If the girls team wins,

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:32.250
all of you boys have to treat me like your master from that moment on!

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:33.770
That condition again?

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:40.830
Just because they've got Futaba on their side, they're thinking it'll be as easy as pie.

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:43.280
Actually, we probably can't even have an even match against them...

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:47.920
Well, it's time to start the dodgeball match of boys versus girls!

00:08:48.530 --> 00:08:49.400
Go ahead!

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:53.890
Whenever possible, avoid tossing in Futaba's direction!

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:55.000
All right!

00:08:57.400 --> 00:09:00.060
What the heck are you guys doing, damned perverted squadron?!

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:03.750
We're doing this because we want Satou's ball to knock us down!

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:06.800
It'll add another ten years, right?!

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:09.030
It will make our skin all glossy too, huh?!

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:12.980
Let's make this a contest to see who can get Satou's ball thrown into her face first, all right?!

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:14.060
H-Hold on just a sec...

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:16.990
We will absolutely not lose to you, Futaba!

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:19.420
I don't really understand it. But,

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:22.320
I won't lose either!

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:24.120
Wait-Not you, too...

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:26.120
Erm...

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.880
Come on, let us have it!

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:29.870
What's the whole deal, anyway?!

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:31.190
For crying out loud!

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:32.300
That can't be?!

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:34.760
You imbecile!

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:37.120
Why didn't you hit them?!

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:38.760
I couldn't have done that!

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:43.340
I'll smash this image into your faces!

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:47.960
That was super-weak!

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:49.680
Not too bad if I say so myself!

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:52.890
Shiori!

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:58.160
I was taken by someone other than Satou...

00:09:58.160 --> 00:09:59.950
And I've been tainted now!

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:12.700
This is revenge for Shiori!

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:16.400
Freaking fast!

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:24.760
Are you still in one piece?

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:25.390
Yeah.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:29.080
Ah, how nice to be out.

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:33.440
Before things get really troublesome, it should be better to leave the playing field.

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:34.930
Satou!

00:10:34.930 --> 00:10:35.900
Huh?

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:37.240
How careless of me,

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:40.260
to think that I would actually hit your face like that!

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:41.710
Let me die in repentance!

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:42.410
What?!

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:44.350
W-Wait just a sec!

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:46.160
She's trying to bite off her tongue!

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:48.260
You should die,

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:51.440
for tarnishing Satou's handsome face!

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:54.170
Since we are your best friends, we will clear your bones for you.

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:55.870
Girls are so...!

00:10:55.870 --> 00:10:57.300
Erm, just a sec,

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.680
this really is just a game, you know!

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:01.420
It didn't even hurt a bit!

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:03.840
Actually, it might have been a great experience!

00:11:06.070 --> 00:11:07.420
Was it really good?

00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:08.140
It was!

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.520
It's better to be out, after all!

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:12.270
Satou!

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:15.060
W-What is happening now?!

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:17.730
Is he actually that glad to have been hit in the face?

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:18.860
Shin.

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:20.780
No wonder he's a pervert.

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:29.200
I want to make you even happier...!

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.130
What?!

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:32.660
No, that's not what I meant!

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:35.360
Well, anyway, I'm out now.

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:36.250
I'm leaving the field now.

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:38.390
Those headshots don't count, you know.

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:38.880
What?

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:44.290
Stop it...!!!

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:50.980
The "Helplessly In Love" Squadron's

00:11:47.610 --> 00:11:50.980
Daily Routine

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:50.810
The "Helplessly In Love" Squadron's mornings always start early.

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:55.150
Satou's shoebox!

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:56.100
All clear!

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:57.770
Satou's desk!

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:59.530
Nothing worth mentioning!

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.030
Not a thing.

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:02.080
Nothing at all.

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:03.530
Not a single thing, huh?

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:10.110
Do you really take your books, indoor shoes, recorder, and everything else back home everyday?

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:10.910
Yeah, that's right.

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:13.450
It's because I'm kind of scared some things might happen...

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:17.290
And just like that, the "Helplessly In Love" Squad's day ends.

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:35.570
Oga-chin, you're so pro!

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:39.330
That's because I've been practicing this soccer game that Satou loves so much!

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:41.740
You've gotten one step closer to Satou, huh?

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:44.610
Just by kicking this ball around,

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:48.580
I feel as if I'm becoming one with Satou's soul.

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:51.680
That's so unfair! I want to join with him too!

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:52.520
Me, too!

00:12:54.970 --> 00:12:57.660
I want to as well!

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:10.410
Futaba, for you to share Satou's soul,

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:12.080
it is definitely one million years too early!

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:14.520
My soul, it's not for soccer?

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:16.710
Oh, Shin!

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:17.350
Wait there-!

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:21.680
That damn Futaba!

00:13:21.680 --> 00:13:25.230
Although she's a simpleton, she still gets to accompany him everywhere.

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:26.780
I won't forgive this!

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:28.660
Class 3, yo!

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:30.200
Let's play some soccer!

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:31.530
All right, Class 1.

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:32.540
Yay!

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:34.290
Hold it right there!

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:37.170
Let me play instead of Futaba!

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:41.170
You don't want someone to play who will pop the ball with a header, right?

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.920
That was my bad.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:45.420
Although that may true...

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:48.440
It'll be a relief for our side if that's the case.

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:52.750
As a goalkeeper, I'd rather not feel like my life's on the line.

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:55.980
S-Satou!

00:13:55.980 --> 00:14:00.940
Recently, I have been practicing soccer a lot, all for your sake!

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:03.320
I will try my best, so please!

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:04.780
Is that so?

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:05.570
Yes!

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:06.710
I've done it now!

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:08.770
If I can only show him the results of my practice...!

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:13.230
Oga-chin!

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:14.490
Satou!

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:16.800
Let's go for it, Oga-chin!

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:17.960
Yes!

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:26.080
Love's Twin Shoot!

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:32.760
We did it, Satou!

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:33.730
That's right!

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:36.220
I can do this!

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:37.870
Kick-off!

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:44.600
All right, all I have to do is show Satou my great skills!

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:49.660
If I'm even nudged a little bit by another man other than Satou,

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:51.850
my body will definitely decay, you know?!

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:53.700
Then, why did you join in the first place?!

00:14:54.480 --> 00:14:55.660
Damn it!

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:57.810
At this rate, I won't be able to participate!

00:14:58.490 --> 00:15:01.670
Anyway, Satou's ability really is incredible, huh?

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:04.420
It's as if he takes the ball completely for himself, no?

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.320
They say he started playing soccer when he was two years old,

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:08.170
and that he's been with that ball ever since!

00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:10.620
I've even heard that he doesn't let go of the ball when he sleeps either.

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:13.910
Rather than just a friend,

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:15.840
that ball is more like a lover, huh?

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.260
Even though it's just a ball...

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:20.870
Though it's just a ball...

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:24.190
Even if it's a ball, I can't forgive it!

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.940
When Futaba's not around, it sure is peaceful.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:33.490
What an incredible cut-to-the-chase sliding steal!

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:35.580
What are you doing to your own ally?!

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:40.610
Don't you dare to come near him anymore, you damned ball!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.750
Just what the hell are you trying to do by stealing the ball from your ally?

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:51.340
What the?!

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:52.960
As if I'd lose to you!

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:57.170
It disappeared?!

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:04.690
You freakin' damned ball!

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:07.710
Somehow things got even more chaotic than usual, huh?

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:08.820
I don't know anymore...

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:14.410
To think that Satou would like the soccer ball the most...!

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.550
You're wrong, you know!

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:18.850
The balls aren't what Shin likes best.

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:20.700
Wh-What did you say?!

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:27.610
Except for Futaba, it's the first time that a girl could put a stop to my dribble.

00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:29.500
I've changed my mind a bit about this girl.

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:33.300
Hey there, you're actually quite-

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:39.420
Wh-What in the world are you doing?!

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:41.530
You were actually swayed by this?!

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:45.230
So you really do like panties the most!

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:50.120
Th-That's not it! I don't think anyone would have remained unaffected by that!

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:50.880
It's just cloth...

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:52.210
Even though it's just cloth...!

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:53.190
Though it's merely fabric...!

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:55.610
Although you're merely a piece of fabric!!!

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:01.010
Whoa! That's awesome!

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:02.800
Everyone, gather!

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:04.570
Don't lose to Class 3!

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:08.020
Panties! Panties! Panties!

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:10.080
Let's just play soccer already...

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:12.850
To think that I'd lose to nothing more than a piece of fabric...

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:15.520
Losing to mere cloth just like that...!

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:17.710
I just won't wear them anymore!

00:17:19.690 --> 00:17:20.770
I won't wear them!

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:23.030
Well, then, everyone!

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:25.240
Move to your newly appointed seats!

00:17:26.740 --> 00:17:28.070
I'm looking forward to work with you.

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:29.240
On what?

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:31.810
Nah, it's just that this is the first time we've sat near each other.

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:33.820
So, why don't we try to get along?

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:34.650
That won't work.

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:35.570
Why's that?!

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:38.090
First of all, we don't even know a single thing about each other.

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:40.910
Also, I have no clue how the sentiments and "operatives" for getting along with others work.

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.580
From here on out, we can start to know each other, no?!

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:45.190
Well, about me...

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:46.410
My blood type is O; and my sign is Cancer.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:47.930
My favorite hobby would be basketball, I suppose.

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:50.340
I'm part of a district basketball club, you see.

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:53.340
What sort of things are you into, Third Daughter?

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:55.900
My private life isn't anything I'd like to mention.

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:04.540
Why is Third Daughter's heart closed off so much?!

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:07.660
It's nothing serious; that's just how she is.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:09.480
Leave her be, already.

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:13.670
No, I think she actually does want some friends.

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:15.360
It's in her eyes.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:18.440
Miyashita, you can sometimes be really disagreeable.

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:19.610
Now, now.

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:23.690
Nevertheless, she's difficult to talk with since I barely know anything about her,

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:25.690
and she won't tell me anything either.

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:27.360
So could you please tell me something about her?

00:18:29.180 --> 00:18:30.770
Those special effects superhero things?

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:32.090
That's right.

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:34.630
Just to buy one of those toy belts, she went all out and snuck out to get one!

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:37.810
That Hitoha, isn't she just like a kindergartner?

00:18:37.810 --> 00:18:39.000
That's pretty cute, you know.

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:44.270
In return for the information, I demand that you give me your lunch juice!

00:18:44.270 --> 00:18:46.270
Tell me these conditions earlier!

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:49.270
Next is gym!

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:49.270
Let's huurry and change up!!

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:49.270
But, special effects superhero shows, eh?

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:51.770
To be honest, I've never seen anything of it.

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:53.180
I'm not really interested in them that much either...

00:18:53.180 --> 00:18:55.280
I wonder how I should draw out a conversation...

00:18:57.450 --> 00:19:01.780
Although I heard it from Mitsuba, you do like those superhero shows, right?

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:05.900
Don't go prying into people's business; it's repulsive.

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:09.290
I need to proceed with caution.

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:15.700
Th-That thing right now-?!

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:19.420
She even bought a toy belt!

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:22.840
Hey!

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:28.710
Ah, this belt is...!

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:29.600
Do you know what it is?!

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:31.380
But of course!

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:33.290
I love it too!

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:36.810
Miyashita, you were a fan as well?!

00:19:36.810 --> 00:19:38.190
I'm so happy!

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:40.820
All right! Let's talk about them to our heart's content then!

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:42.000
Okay!

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:46.280
After that, if I just need to say whatever sounds suitable...

00:19:46.970 --> 00:19:48.080
This is it!

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.580
Let's go with this!

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:53.670
Well, since we'll be stretching first, go ahead in get in pairs, everyone!

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.640
Miya, would you like to be my-

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:56.750
Work together with me!

00:19:57.550 --> 00:20:00.010
Erm, could someone please...!

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:03.340
One, two, three, four...

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:03.340
Isn't this...

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:06.760
Five, six, seven, eight!

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:06.760
Erm, hey, ow...

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:08.690
Could this possibly be...

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:10.060
S-Stop it-

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:11.920
It's perfectly fine!

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:13.640
This would be that one thing, no?

00:20:14.240 --> 00:20:16.540
I love it too, you know.

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:17.690
Quit it already-

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.420
Miya...!

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:22.520
Ah, no, it isn't like that!

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:25.070
Since Third Daughter has a belt that's-

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:28.810
She totally snuck out to buy this toy belt.

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:30.540
Snuck out to buy it...

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:31.620
Snuck out...

00:20:33.630 --> 00:20:35.040
It's as if...

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:38.190
It's as if something hard was stuck near her stomach!

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:39.380
What?!

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:41.950
Third Daughter was a boy after all?!

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:43.260
No, you're wrong!

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:45.760
Third <i>Daughter</i>, do show it!

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:46.770
Stop!

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:49.670
It'll be fine so show it to us already!

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:51.420
I'm saying it's not that way!

00:20:51.420 --> 00:20:53.320
Third <i>Daughter</i>, show us!

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:55.350
Third Daughter?!

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:02.940
Th-That is...?

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:06.200
I'm sick of all these good-for-nothing misconceptions and misunderstandings!

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:08.360
It's fine if you see me as a fool!

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:09.650
For all I care, you can laugh at me as well!

00:21:09.650 --> 00:21:13.580
Even so, I can't help but like the Gachi Rangers!

00:21:16.070 --> 00:21:17.650
Those folks, I know them too.

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:21.690
"We'll put a stop to all tendencies of carelessness and thoughtlessness," right?

00:21:21.690 --> 00:21:25.840
Ah right. That's that show even adults are enjoying a lot nowadays, no?

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:28.160
Third Daughter, you also liked them, then?!

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:30.100
I like the black ranger the most!

00:21:30.410 --> 00:21:32.600
From time to time, I also watch them, you know.

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:34.680
I like 'em too, those Gachi Rang!

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:35.850
For real, they're so cool!

00:21:38.390 --> 00:21:40.940
I also like, what, the green one, myself!

00:21:42.520 --> 00:21:44.840
Such a color... doesn't exist!

00:21:44.840 --> 00:21:45.860
What-?!

00:21:47.470 --> 00:21:50.660
Come on now, could we please continue stretching?

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:54.730
Really, I don't have a clue what they're talking about...

00:22:18.060 --> 00:22:23.150
As the sun sets on the schoolyard

00:22:23.290 --> 00:22:28.420
I waved my hand, and head back home

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:33.600
Tonight, when I go to bed

00:22:33.770 --> 00:22:38.900
It'd be great if I can see you again

00:22:39.180 --> 00:22:44.450
Let's go to sleep

00:22:44.450 --> 00:22:48.400
I can't wait for tomorrow

00:22:50.590 --> 00:22:55.490
It's really wonderful in my dream, you see...

00:22:55.860 --> 00:23:00.390
You can even fly into the sky

00:23:01.100 --> 00:23:14.940
My heart aches when I hold your hand, even in my dream

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:20.400
Just like my dream-colored love

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:28.660
The last episode is up next,

00:23:28.660 --> 00:23:29.880
but since we're not doing anything special,

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:31.390
it's futile to expect something cool.

00:23:31.390 --> 00:23:34.310
That's right! It'll just be your usual Mitsudomoe!

00:23:34.310 --> 00:23:35.770
Has the preview ended yet?

00:23:35.250 --> 00:23:41.010
A Day at the Marui House

00:23:35.770 --> 00:23:39.080
We're on our way then!
